{
  "script_id": "geodesic-shortest-path",
  "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
  "voice_key": "xiaoxiao",
  "files": [
    {
      "script_id": "geodesic-shortest-path",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-1",
      "filename": "intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/geodesic-shortest-path/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.6,
      "size": 57600,
      "text": "打开航班追踪软件看北京飞纽约，你会发现航线在地图上是一条明显向北弯的弧，几乎贴到北极圈。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "geodesic-shortest-path",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-2",
      "filename": "intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/geodesic-shortest-path/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.67,
      "size": 58752,
      "text": "两个城市纬度差不多，都在北纬四十度上下。既然如此，为什么不干脆沿着北纬四十度一路向东飞过去？"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "geodesic-shortest-path",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-3",
      "filename": "intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/geodesic-shortest-path/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.7,
      "size": 43200,
      "text": "因为地图骗了你。平面地图上看着直的线，在球面上其实是绕远路。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "geodesic-shortest-path",
      "section_id": "compare",
      "line_id": "cp-1",
      "filename": "compare-cp-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/geodesic-shortest-path/xiaoxiao/compare-cp-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.31,
      "size": 52992,
      "text": "把两条路径都算出来。沿纬线走，弧长等于纬度余弦乘经度差，再加上纬度差那一小段。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "geodesic-shortest-path",
      "section_id": "compare",
      "line_id": "cp-2",
      "filename": "compare-cp-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/geodesic-shortest-path/xiaoxiao/compare-cp-2.mp3",
      "duration": 4.16,
      "size": 66528,
      "text": "大圆弧走，直接用球面距离公式。屏幕上的读数是：大圆一万零九百九十公里，沿纬线一万四千三百八十四公里。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "geodesic-shortest-path",
      "section_id": "compare",
      "line_id": "cp-3",
      "filename": "compare-cp-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/geodesic-shortest-path/xiaoxiao/compare-cp-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.91,
      "size": 46512,
      "text": "差距超过三千公里，多出百分之三十一。按巡航速度算，等于白飞四个小时。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "geodesic-shortest-path",
      "section_id": "north",
      "line_id": "nt-1",
      "filename": "north-nt-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/geodesic-shortest-path/xiaoxiao/north-nt-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.4,
      "size": 54432,
      "text": "关键在于纬线的长度随纬度收缩。赤道一圈四万公里，北纬六十度那一圈只剩两万公里。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "geodesic-shortest-path",
      "section_id": "north",
      "line_id": "nt-2",
      "filename": "north-nt-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/geodesic-shortest-path/xiaoxiao/north-nt-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.8,
      "size": 44784,
      "text": "所以往高纬度绕，虽然在平面地图上看着弯，实际走过的地表距离反而更短。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "geodesic-shortest-path",
      "section_id": "north",
      "line_id": "nt-3",
      "filename": "north-nt-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/geodesic-shortest-path/xiaoxiao/north-nt-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.84,
      "size": 61488,
      "text": "屏幕上标出了这条大圆航线的最高纬度：北纬八十三点九度，比两端城市高出四十多度，已经在北极圈内了。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "geodesic-shortest-path",
      "section_id": "curvature",
      "line_id": "cv-1",
      "filename": "curvature-cv-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/geodesic-shortest-path/xiaoxiao/curvature-cv-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.86,
      "size": 61776,
      "text": "更本质的问法是：球面上什么才算直？答案是测地曲率为零。这个量衡量路径在球面内部弯了多少。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "geodesic-shortest-path",
      "section_id": "curvature",
      "line_id": "cv-2",
      "filename": "curvature-cv-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/geodesic-shortest-path/xiaoxiao/curvature-cv-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.34,
      "size": 53424,
      "text": "大圆弧的测地曲率精确为零，屏幕上数值验证到十的负十二次方。它就是球面上的直线。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "geodesic-shortest-path",
      "section_id": "curvature",
      "line_id": "cv-3",
      "filename": "curvature-cv-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/geodesic-shortest-path/xiaoxiao/curvature-cv-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.83,
      "size": 77328,
      "text": "纬线就不同了。纬度为四十五度的那条纬线，测地曲率恰好等于一；六十度那条等于根号三。只有赤道是零，因为赤道本身就是大圆。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "geodesic-shortest-path",
      "section_id": "detour",
      "line_id": "dt-1",
      "filename": "detour-dt-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/geodesic-shortest-path/xiaoxiao/detour-dt-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.92,
      "size": 46656,
      "text": "请拖动绕道滑块。它把大圆弧的中点朝侧向推开一个角度，再重新连接两端。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "geodesic-shortest-path",
      "section_id": "detour",
      "line_id": "dt-2",
      "filename": "detour-dt-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/geodesic-shortest-path/xiaoxiao/detour-dt-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.25,
      "size": 51984,
      "text": "偏移为零时长度与大圆精确相同，只要偏移一点，长度立刻变大，而且随偏移单调增加。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "geodesic-shortest-path",
      "section_id": "detour",
      "line_id": "dt-3",
      "filename": "detour-dt-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/geodesic-shortest-path/xiaoxiao/detour-dt-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.64,
      "size": 74304,
      "text": "最后提一个例外。如果两点恰好对径，比如南北极，那么有无穷多条等长的最短路径，长度都是圆周率。此时最短路径不唯一。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "geodesic-shortest-path",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-1",
      "filename": "summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/geodesic-shortest-path/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.09,
      "size": 49392,
      "text": "第一，球面最短路径是大圆弧，比沿纬线的航线短，北京到纽约能省三千多公里。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "geodesic-shortest-path",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-2",
      "filename": "summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/geodesic-shortest-path/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.03,
      "size": 48528,
      "text": "第二，测地曲率为零才算球面上的直线，大圆弧满足，纬线除赤道外都不满足。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "geodesic-shortest-path",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-3",
      "filename": "summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/geodesic-shortest-path/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.76,
      "size": 60192,
      "text": "第三，任何偏离大圆的绕道都严格更长，但对径点处最短路径不唯一。感谢观看，我们下次再见。"
    }
  ],
